                    <div id="manualContent">

                        <!-- DASHBOARD -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-dashboard">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#4a90e2"><i class="fas fa-tachometer-alt me-2"></i>Dashboard</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">The Dashboard is your real-time overview. Every number is clickable.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accDashboard">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#d1">What are the stat cards at the top?</button>
                                    <div id="d1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accDashboard">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">The four cards &mdash; <strong>Active Patients</strong>, <strong>Pending RX</strong>, <strong>Total RX</strong>, and <strong>Total Patients</strong> &mdash; update live. Clicking any card number opens a filtered modal showing exactly those records. Use the date range filter to scope to any period.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#d2">What is a Pending RX?</button>
                                    <div id="d2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accDashboard">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">An RX is "pending" when its workflow is not 100% complete &mdash; at least one step is still unchecked. Once all workflow steps are marked complete, it leaves the pending count.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#d3">RX Pipeline chart</button>
                                    <div id="d3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#accDashboard">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Shows how many RX records are stuck at each workflow step. The longest bar is your bottleneck. Hover any bar for the exact count.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- PATIENTS -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-patients">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#6366f1"><i class="fas fa-user-injured me-2"></i>Patients</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">The core of the system. Every patient has a record, clinical notes, and a full RX history timeline.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accPatients">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#p1">Adding a new patient</button>
                                    <div id="p1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Click <strong>"+ Add Patient"</strong>. Fill in First Name, Last Name, Date of Birth, Phone. Optionally add Patient Code, Clinic, and Transport companies. The system checks for duplicates by name + date of birth before saving.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#p2">Editing a patient &mdash; and the Audit Log</button>
                                    <div id="p2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Click the <strong>pencil ✏️</strong> icon. Every saved change is automatically recorded in the Audit Log with the old and new values.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#p3">⭐ Clicking the bold action in the Audit Log</button>
                                    <div id="p3" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">In the Audit Log, each row shows an action like <strong>"UPDATE"</strong> in bold. <strong>Click that word</strong> &mdash; a panel expands showing the exact before and after values for every field that changed. Old values appear with a red strikethrough. New values appear highlighted in green. Works for patients, RX records, users, settings, API keys, and workflow completions.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#p4">Patient Timeline &mdash; full RX history</button>
                                    <div id="p4" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Click the <strong>clock/timeline icon 🕐</strong> to open the patient's full RX history. Shows every RX record as a vertical timeline with progress bars, workflow steps, medications, and who completed each step.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#p5">Soft delete and restore</button>
                                    <div id="p5" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Patients are never permanently deleted. Deleting hides them from the main list but admins can restore them. This protects against accidental data loss.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- RX RECORDS -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-rx">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#22c55e"><i class="fas fa-prescription me-2"></i>RX Records</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">Each RX record is a prescription delivery tracked through workflow steps.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accRx">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#rx1">Creating an RX record</button>
                                    <div id="rx1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Click <strong>"+ Add RX Record"</strong>. Select the patient, pharmacy, arrival date, service date, transport companies, and optionally medications. The RX starts with 0/N steps complete.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#rx2">Workflow step dots &mdash; what they mean</button>
                                    <div id="rx2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted"><strong>Green dot = completed step. Grey dot = pending.</strong> Hover any dot to see the step name, who completed it, and the date/time. Click a step in the expanded view to mark it complete.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#rx3">Undo last workflow step</button>
                                    <div id="rx3" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Each RX has an <strong>"Undo"</strong> button that reverts the most recently completed step. Only the last step can be undone at a time. Useful when a step was marked complete by mistake.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- WORKFLOW -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-workflow">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#f59e0b"><i class="fas fa-tasks me-2"></i>Workflow Actions (Steps)</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">The configurable steps that every RX must go through. Go to Settings &rarr; Workflow Actions to manage them.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accWF">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#wf1">What are Workflow Actions?</button>
                                    <div id="wf1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Named steps of your delivery process. Examples: "Prescription Received", "Medication Packaged", "Dispatched", "Delivered", "Patient Confirmed". Every RX is tracked against this list.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#wf2">Adding / editing steps</button>
                                    <div id="wf2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Go to <strong>Settings &rarr; Workflow Actions</strong>. Click "+ Add Step". Give it a name and description. Steps apply immediately to all new RX records. Existing records keep their current progress.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- REPORTS -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-reports">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#06b6d4"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar me-2"></i>Reports & Analytics</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">Export, print, and email reports from the Reports page.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accReports">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#rep1">Report tabs</button>
                                    <div id="rep1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Four views: <strong>Summary</strong> (KPI overview), <strong>Patients</strong> (full list), <strong>RX Records</strong> (all prescriptions), <strong>Workflow Actions</strong> (step completion per RX).</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#rep2">📧 Email Report button</button>
                                    <div id="rep2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Click <strong>"📧 Email Report"</strong> in the report tab bar. Choose the report type, enter recipient email(s) (comma-separated), optional subject, and date range. Click <strong>"Test Connection"</strong> first to verify SMTP works, then <strong>"Send Report"</strong>. SMTP must be configured in System Settings &rarr; Email Setup first.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- AUDIT LOG -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-audit">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#8b5cf6"><i class="fas fa-history me-2"></i>Audit Log</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">Records every action taken by every user. Nothing is hidden. Administrators only.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accAudit">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#au1">⭐ Clicking the bold action word (most important)</button>
                                    <div id="au1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted"><strong>Click the bold action word</strong> (e.g. "UPDATE", "CREATE", "DELETE") in any audit log row. A panel expands showing the complete before/after diff. Old values have red strikethrough. New values are green. Fields that did not change are grey. Works for ALL record types.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#au2">Filters</button>
                                    <div id="au2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Filter by date range, user, module (Patients / RX / Users / Settings etc.), and action type. Combine multiple filters. Click "Clear" to reset.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- USERS -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-users">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#ef4444"><i class="fas fa-users-cog me-2"></i>User Management</h6>
                            <p class="text-muted small">Manage staff accounts. Administrator access only.</p>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accUsers">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#u1">Roles and permissions</button>
                                    <div id="u1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted"><strong>Administrator</strong> &mdash; full access including user management and system settings. <strong>Manager</strong> &mdash; all patient/RX data and reports, no user/settings management. <strong>Staff</strong> &mdash; add/edit patients and RX records, complete workflow steps. <strong>Viewer</strong> &mdash; read-only access, no editing.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#u2">Changing a password</button>
                                    <div id="u2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Edit the user, enter a new password. Leave blank to keep the current password. Passwords are stored as bcrypt hashes &mdash; they cannot be read by anyone, including admins.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- SETTINGS GENERAL -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-settings">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#64748b"><i class="fas fa-cog me-2"></i>System Settings &mdash; General</h6>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accSetGen">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#sg1">Timezone setting</button>
                                    <div id="sg1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Sets the timezone for ALL timestamps &mdash; audit logs, RX dates, workflow completions. Applies immediately without server restart. Stored in the database so it persists across restarts. If the server runs in UTC but you're in Eastern time, set "America/New_York" here.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- EMAIL SETUP -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-email">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#6366f1"><i class="fas fa-envelope me-2"></i>System Settings &mdash; Email Setup</h6>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accEmail">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#em1">Gmail &mdash; App Password required</button>
                                    <div id="em1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Gmail requires a special <strong>App Password</strong> (not your regular password). 1) Go to <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/security" target="_blank">myaccount.google.com/security</a>. 2) Enable 2-Step Verification. 3) Search "App Passwords". 4) Create one for "Mail". 5) Paste the 16-character code in the Password field. Use the Quick Setup button to auto-fill Gmail server settings.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#em2">Test Connection and Send Test Email</button>
                                    <div id="em2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">Always click <strong>"Test Connection"</strong> after saving to verify SMTP credentials work. Then use <strong>"Send Test Email"</strong> to verify end-to-end delivery to any address.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- API Keys manual section moved to Backoffice -->

                        <!-- MULTI-USER -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-multiuser">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#22c55e"><i class="fas fa-users me-2"></i>Multi-User / Concurrent Access</h6>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accMulti">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mu1">👁️ The yellow viewer banner</button>
                                    <div id="mu1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">If a colleague has the same patient open, a <strong>yellow banner</strong> appears: "👁️ Maria is also viewing this patient." This is informational only &mdash; it does not block editing. The banner updates every 60 seconds.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mu2">TTL &mdash; what is the 5-minute expiry?</button>
                                    <div id="mu2" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">TTL = "Time To Live." When a user opens a patient, a 5-minute lock is created. The page sends a <strong>heartbeat every 60 seconds</strong> to renew it. If the user closes the tab or goes idle, the lock expires after 5 minutes and the banner disappears automatically. This prevents phantom "someone is viewing" notices when a user just forgot to close a tab.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mu3">Two users saving the same patient</button>
                                    <div id="mu3" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">"Last save wins" &mdash; whoever saves last overwrites the previous save for any overlapping fields. The yellow banner warns you this might happen. The Audit Log records both saves so you can always see what each user changed and restore values if needed.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- IMPORT -->
                        <div class="glass-card p-4 mb-3" id="man-import">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0ea5e9"><i class="fas fa-file-import me-2"></i>Data Import</h6>
                            <div class="accordion" id="accImport">
                                <div class="accordion-item border-0 mb-1" style="background:var(--bg-subtle,#f8fafc);border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden">
                                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-semibold small" style="background:transparent" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#im1">How to import patients from CSV</button>
                                    <div id="im1" class="accordion-collapse collapse">
                                        <div class="accordion-body small text-muted">1) Click "Download Template" to get the correct column headers. 2) Fill in the template &mdash; dates must be YYYY-MM-DD format. 3) Upload the CSV. 4) Review the results table showing which rows succeeded and which failed (with reasons). Duplicates (same name + DOB) are skipped with a warning.</div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

